WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.510
One white handkerchief,
spotted with strawberries.

2
00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.040
Watch where it goes.

3
00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:06.360
Pushed away.

4
00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:07.270
Dropped.

5
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:08.350
Picked up.

6
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.620
Handed over.

7
00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:10.990
Left in a room.

8
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:12.300
Given away.

9
00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:14.920
And all the while, there is no affair.

10
00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.010
Desdemona is innocent.

11
00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.190
Yet her husband grows
certain she has betrayed him.

12
00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:23.410
How can jealousy grow
when nothing has happened?

13
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:27.420
In this mission, you'll hear Iago's
questions and hints in Act 3,

14
00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:28.880
line by line.

15
00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:31.660
You'll put the so-called proof on trial.

16
00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:35.100
And you'll meet what Iago
calls "the green-ey’d monster",

17
00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:37.970
then hear Emilia's own view of jealousy.

18
00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:41.870
Your mission: work out where
Othello's jealousy comes from.
